sequenceDiagram
  participant Data as C4 spans
  participant Encoder
  participant Decoder
  participant FFN as Gated FFN
  participant Loss
  Data->>Encoder: corrupted input
  Encoder->>Decoder: encoded states / cross-attention
  Data->>Decoder: teacher-forced targets
  Decoder->>FFN: per-position hidden state
  FFN->>Decoder: f(XW) ⊙ XV then W₂
  Decoder->>Loss: vocabulary logits / cross-entropy
  Note over Decoder,FFN: Inference computes current token; Attention reuses KV
